{"song_id": 31520, "title": "Superhero", "language": "en", "lyricists": "[70, 1264]", "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "chorus", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "\"He\u2019s a super\u2014\"", "rhyme": "ER"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Hero", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Jet Jaguar's a superhero", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Jet Jaguar's a superhero", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Jet Jaguar's a superhero", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Jet Jaguar's a superhero", "rhyme": "o"}], "rhyme": "ABBBBB", "rhyme_vowel": "ABBBBB"}, {"section_id": "section_1", "type": "verse", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Here to save rap", "rhyme": "ap"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Always working on new flows, not the same crap", "rhyme": "ap"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Operation Doomsday, the day after mission", "rhyme": "$"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Hot to death, iron chef, vocals in the kitchen", "rhyme": "En"}, {"n": "4", "text": "The world wants to know how we follow up a classic", "rhyme": "ik"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Did we lose our hunger?  Do we have the magic?", "rhyme": "ik"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Day By Day, Metal Face, together, yes, we build this", "rhyme": "i"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Now it\u2019s double homicide because, again, we killed this", "rhyme": "i"}, {"n": "8", "text": "MF DOOM and MF Grimm", "rhyme": "EtR"}, {"n": "9", "text": "Put \u2018em back together\u2014and you can\u2019t win", "rhyme": ")"}, {"n": "10", "text": "\u2018Cause it can\u2019t lose, so, what the hell?", "rhyme": "El"}, {"n": "11", "text": "While others choose to rock \u2018em, we kill you with bells", "rhyme": "El"}, {"n": "12", "text": "I\u2019ll resurrect you with some Special Herbs", "rhyme": "9b"}, {"n": "13", "text": "Or we\u2019re hurting birds with some special words", "rhyme": "OR"}, {"n": "14", "text": "Punks think they\u2019re gangsta, but they\u2019re really herbs", "rhyme": "9b"}, {"n": "15", "text": "\u2018cause when they empty a clip, it\u2019ll test your nerves", "rhyme": "ERv"}, {"n": "16", "text": "Gangsta keep a straight face\u2014you start to swerve", "rhyme": "ERv"}, {"n": "17", "text": "All that street shit change, you\u2019re on the curve", "rhyme": "yRv"}, {"n": "18", "text": "Hollering like a bitch, what happened to the hard-talk?", "rhyme": "Ok"}, {"n": "19", "text": "Street shit is gone, now you\u2019re driving on the sidewalk", "rhyme": "Ok"}, {"n": "20", "text": "Destiny is moving, looking at you funny", "rhyme": "i"}, {"n": "21", "text": "They see you were driving in the streets for the money", "rhyme": "E"}, {"n": "22", "text": "Lost your respect, now your face you try to hide", "rhyme": "id"}, {"n": "23", "text": "We refuse to stop and let you slide", "rhyme": "id"}, {"n": "24", "text": "I know this is eating you up inside", "rhyme": "id"}, {"n": "25", "text": "Day By Day distribution now worldwide", "rhyme": "id"}, {"n": "26", "text": "No longer honorable, you\u2019re a fucking crook", "rhyme": "uk"}, {"n": "27", "text": "You better get new guidance, your manager is shook", "rhyme": "uk"}, {"n": "28", "text": "Hiding behind cellphones and emails", "rhyme": "El"}, {"n": "29", "text": "He\u2019s a little bitch, between his legs is his tail", "rhyme": "aj"}, {"n": "30", "text": "Three years ago, I left\u2014that\u2019s a fact\u2014", "rhyme": "akt"}, {"n": "31", "text": "But now I came back to save rap!", "rhyme": "ap"}], "rhyme": "AABCDDEEFGHHIJIKKLMMENOOOOPPHQRA", "rhyme_vowel": "AABCDDDDCECCFGFCCHGGDCDDDDIICAAA"}, {"section_id": "section_2", "type": "chorus", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Jet Jaguar's a superhero (M-I-C)", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Jet Jaguar's a superhero (N-Y-C)", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Jet Jaguar's a superhero (M-I-C)", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Jet Jaguar's a superhero (N-Y-C)", "rhyme": "o"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Jet Jaguar's a superhero (M-I-C)", "rhyme": "o"}], "rhyme": "AAAAA", "rhyme_vowel": "AAAAA"}, {"section_id": "